From fda1803715f5a9763c2baea5f6096bd90c40bf2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Van Flandern <mvf@vanvlaenderen.org>
Date: Sun, 12 Apr 2026 00:46:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] content: add BibliographyPage (/research/bibliography)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New page with two sections:
- I. Primary Sources and Finding Aids (charter compilations, chronicles,
  archival records directly consulted, finding aids) — 11 entries
- II. Scholarly Literature (Counts of Flanders, Meetjesland regional
  history, prosopography/methodology, genetic genealogy) — 11 entries

Each entry has typed badge (Primary Source / Finding Aid / Belgian
Historiography / Meetjesland / Methodology / Genetic Genealogy),
full citation, annotation, and access link where available.

Wired into App.tsx, pageMeta.ts, prerender.mjs (now 15/15 routes),
useNav.ts. 'Sources & Scholarship' nav link added to ResearchPage
alongside the Methodology & Sources link.
